      "reasons": [
        "The term is a legal remedy in intellectual property and civil liability, not a cognition/psychology concept, so the requested field/sense is not defensible.",
        "The definition adds a broad generalization about “a person’s actual loss” and punishment/deterrence in general law; while the packet supports excess over actual losses and deterrence, it does not support the psychology/counselling framing implied by the entry.",
        "The second sentence is awkwardly inserted as a meta-commentary on the packet rather than a definition; the packet supports difficulty of proof/low compensation in IP disputes, but not as part of the core term definition."
